WEBVTT

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:20.680
<i><i><i>...Vector...           ...Vector...           ...Vector...!</i></i></i>

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:23.800
<i>It wasn't me...! It wasn't me...!</i>

00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:40.420
Anything wrong, Vector?

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:43.200
It's <i>nothing</i>.

00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:46.040
Nasch will be here anytime soon.

00:00:47.170 --> 00:00:50.260
And he'll be livid with anger.

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:52.330
I know.

00:00:52.730 --> 00:00:55.000
Looks like this will be the <i>finale</i>.

00:00:58.910 --> 00:01:01.370
What are you up to, Vector?!

00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:04.680
Nothing, there's just no need for you to show up.

00:01:04.890 --> 00:01:07.860
I've got something to settle with Nasch.

00:01:12.770 --> 00:01:15.370
Since I took power from Merag and the others,

00:01:15.640 --> 00:01:18.910
my own <i>Power</i> seems to have risen considerably.

00:01:21.940 --> 00:01:24.460
Vector!

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:30.480
Vector!

00:01:31.530 --> 00:01:33.330
I've been waiting for you.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:39.530
There is the entrance to the Barian World.

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:42.060
Let's get in then, Yuma.

00:01:42.260 --> 00:01:46.040
Sure! We'll smash Don Thousand for sure!

00:01:49.990 --> 00:01:50.440
{marker}

00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:54.620
WONDER WINGS, will you carry me...

00:01:55.240 --> 00:01:59.860
...to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF!

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:11.550
The Duel that decides our fate,

00:02:11.910 --> 00:02:15.730
now, show me your [Heart] CARD

00:02:18.490 --> 00:02:22.550
Words aren't enough to satisfy

00:02:22.930 --> 00:02:26.530
the feelings I want to express.

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:35.550
Beside you, I've always been dreaming the same

00:02:36.110 --> 00:02:38.800
Right now, with you

00:02:38.950 --> 00:02:42.730
Oh - By facing each other,

00:02:43.060 --> 00:02:49.810
... to create a new future, let's Shining Draw!

00:02:50.790 --> 00:02:54.910
On WONDER WINGS, you carry me...

00:02:55.440 --> 00:03:00.340
... don't let us ever untie our hands,

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:05.510
<i>Kattobing</i> from the sun...

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:15.090
... on to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF TO THE FUTURE!

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:25.260
You bastard... how dare you do that to Merag and Durbe.

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:28.560
Yeah, it was a pleasure to absorb them.

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:30.560
<i>Sinister Memories!
Nasch vs. Vector the Devil!!</i>

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:31.230
But that's not all...

00:03:31.560 --> 00:03:34.690
I also received the power of Gilag and Alit.

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:36.730
Wha- what?!

00:03:39.990 --> 00:03:43.070
You bastard! Vector!

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:50.960
I'm afraid, overeating souls was rather rich for my tummy,

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:52.420
I guess,

00:03:52.420 --> 00:03:56.920
to support digestion, I'll just smash you and take your power too.

00:03:57.210 --> 00:03:58.420
I...

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:01.670
...<i>never</i> thought, I could hate someone as much...

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:03.680
... as <i>YOU</i>!

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:08.850
Sweet, your face is just matchless.

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:10.390
Vector!!

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:13.560
Talking and whining won't lead us anywhere!

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:20.650
The only way to settle the score between you and me is dueling!

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:22.650
Right, Nasch!

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:26.240
Let's go! Vector!

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:41.960
DUEL!

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:45.680
I'll crush you damn bastard!

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:48.010
Just you're the one who gets crushed!

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:51.350
I go first! My turn! Draw!

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:59.110
I activate the Continuous Spell Card "Don Thousand's Contract"!

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:04.650
To activate this card, my opponent pays 2000 of his Life Points.

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:07.160
I pay with <i>my</i> Life Points!?

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:10.700
Of course, you're in <i>my</i> castle!

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:12.750
If you're going to Duel me here,

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:15.460
I sure won't pay any bills in my place!

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:21.050
Whatever suits you bastard, I'll crush you anyways.

00:05:21.590 --> 00:05:23.510
I'm not jokin', bastard.

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:25.470
We're signing a deal here!

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:36.690
Serves you right! After signing "Don Thousand's Contract"

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:40.270
both players draw 1 card and reveal the card they draw to their opponent!

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:46.150
And then, every turn from now on, we have to show what cards we draw.

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:48.490
And if that card was a Magic Card,

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:53.080
the player can not normal summon until the end of the turn!

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:54.410
Now, let's draw.

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:57.580
Draw!

00:05:58.330 --> 00:05:59.500
Draw!

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:04.880
I drew "Split Defender", a Magic Card.

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:08.840
Uh-oh, guess who just got <i>lucky</i>!

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:12.760
Well, what I drew... is a Monster card!

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:15.980
Come, Umbral Golem!

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:22.480
And then I set 2 cards and end my turn!

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:31.240
This is the Barian World?

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:34.700
For sure, Vector and Don Thousand are here.

00:06:35.490 --> 00:06:36.290
Yeah...

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:41.210
Merag... Durbe...

00:06:42.540 --> 00:06:46.260
Your grief... I'll definitely...

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:52.260
Barian's Chaos Draw!

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:57.310
Come on, the effect of "Don Thousand's Contract"...

00:06:58.140 --> 00:07:01.350
... requires players reveal the cards they draw.

00:07:02.060 --> 00:07:05.480
I drew a... Magic Card.

00:07:05.780 --> 00:07:07.650
What a pity!

00:07:07.690 --> 00:07:12.160
Until the end of this turn,
you just <i>can't</i> Normal Summon any Monsters.

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:16.620
It's Rank-Up-Magic "The Seventh One"!

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:18.200
Wha... What the hell!?

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:21.620
You should well know what this card's effect is.

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:25.750
Come forth, Number 101!

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:29.220
Unappeased Soul, placed aboard the Ark!

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:32.680
Arise from the deepest Abyss where no Light will reach!

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:35.350
Silent Honors Ark Knight!

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:40.140
Then I activate the other effect of "The Seventh One".

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:42.810
I Overlay my Rank 4 "Ark Knight"!

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:47.230
and re-build the Overlay Network with this one monster!

00:07:48.610 --> 00:07:50.900
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:54.070
Come forth, Chaos Number 101!

00:07:54.820 --> 00:07:57.240
Guardian of the Insatiable Souls!

00:07:57.330 --> 00:08:00.500
Become the Dark Knight and crush the Light!

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:03.500
Silent Honors Dark Knight!

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:08.710
So that's your Chaos Over Hundred Number!?

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:11.260
But too bad, though.

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:16.050
My Umbral Golem on my field can negate an attack once per turn.

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:20.310
Useless! Behold Dark Knight's power!

00:08:20.730 --> 00:08:21.930
What?!

00:08:22.390 --> 00:08:24.600
I activate Dark Knight's effect!

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:28.230
Once per turn, one monster on my opponent's field

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:31.780
can be turned into a Chaos Overlay Unit of this card!

00:08:31.990 --> 00:08:33.820
Dark Soul Over!

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:38.620
With this, your pathetic wall of a monster is <i>gone</i>.

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:39.540
Eeek!

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:42.750
I'll have my Dark Knight attack directly!

00:08:42.910 --> 00:08:45.460
Be crushed, Vector!

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:54.380
What was that?

00:08:55.470 --> 00:08:57.340
Yuma!
Right!

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:04.940
Get up! This fight is still on!

00:09:05.730 --> 00:09:08.610
I'll erase every little bit of you from existence!

00:09:09.320 --> 00:09:11.570
2800 damage...

00:09:14.990 --> 00:09:16.780
Thanks a ton!

00:09:18.570 --> 00:09:19.740
Idiot!

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:23.200
You know, I've been watching your Duel with IV.

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:28.580
I'm pretty damn well aware how scary that Over Hundred Number of yours is.

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:34.800
Enraged as you are, I thought you'll go straight for inflicting some massive damage to me,

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:37.340
with that Dark Knight, right!

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:42.640
Trap activate, "Chaos Rising"!

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:44.480
This card...

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:49.900
can be activated, if my opponent inflicts 2000 or more Battle Damage to me using a Chaos Number!

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:51.320
What?!

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:56.650
I expected <i>every</i> last move you moron just made.

00:09:56.990 --> 00:10:01.950
I can Special Summon 1 "Chaos Number" monster at random from my Extra Deck!

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:05.960
Appear, Chaos Number 65!

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:10.040
Judge Devil the Adjudicutting Demon King!

00:10:14.130 --> 00:10:18.050
Why would you plan to take 2800 damage,

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:21.010
to <i>just</i> Special Summon a "Chaos Number"...?

00:10:23.310 --> 00:10:26.390
I set 1 card and end my turn.

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:28.890
Now, it's my turn...

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:32.770
This Draw will be the one that decides your fate.

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:34.320
What do you mean?

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:37.950
Here I go! Draw!

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:44.200
Whoopsi, looks like I drew a Magic Card.

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:46.950
But it's not just <i>any</i> Magic Card.

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:49.750
I activate "Chaos Feeding Frenzy"!

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:54.460
If I control a "Chaos Number" on my field, this card allows me

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:58.420
to send a "Don Thousand's Contract" I control to the Graveyard to activate it!

00:10:59.050 --> 00:11:03.470
Then I can chose 3 "Chaos Over Hundred Number" monsters from my Extra Deck,

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:06.600
to Special Summon them with their effects negated.

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:07.930
What did you say!?

00:11:08.310 --> 00:11:10.980
First, Chaos Number 104!

00:11:11.350 --> 00:11:14.150
Masquerade Magician Umbral!

00:11:17.650 --> 00:11:21.660
And now, let me introduce some new friends of mine.

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:24.030
Chaos Number 102!

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:26.700
That's Durbe's...!

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:30.580
Unholy Lightning Noble Daemon!

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:38.130
And... last but not least... This one?

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:42.890
Let's greet her with a big applause!

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:45.930
Apear, Chaos Number 103!

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:49.270
Ragna Infinity the God-Slaying Zero Maiden!

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:54.810
Merag...

00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:58.230
Originally they were Merag's and Durbe's,

00:11:58.480 --> 00:12:01.950
but now <i>THEY - ARE - MY -</i>

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:04.910
- Chaos Numbers!

00:12:06.740 --> 00:12:08.290
Vector...!

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:11.040
How's this, Nasch?

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:13.040
How's it feelin' to see your buddies'

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:15.830
Numbers on your enemy's, <i>my</i> field?

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:18.590
You feel lonely? Does it hurt?

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:23.380
No Merag and no Durbe anymore...

00:12:23.720 --> 00:12:28.350
Nor Gilag or Alit. They all, all, <i>all are mine</i>!

00:12:28.970 --> 00:12:32.520
You're alone! Completely alone!

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:34.100
Alone...

00:12:34.850 --> 00:12:36.400
Shark!

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:42.490
Hoo... That git...

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:49.290
Shark!

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:54.790
Ain't that good, Nasch!

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:59.800
There you are, <i>utterly</i> alone, and up pops your old <i>bestest</i> buddy ever, right?

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:03.420
Can it! That guy and I are enemies now!

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:05.300
Shark...!

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:08.510
You've been <i>dumped</i>, Yuma-<i>kun</i>, poor diddy-pooh.

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:10.260
Vector!

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:12.430
But it's allrighty, sweetums!

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:15.940
When this Duel is over, I'll gonna <i>play</i> with you guys next,

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:18.980
and I'll do it nice and slowly, just for you!

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:21.230
There won't be a <i>next</i> for you!

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:25.360
So you think, you'll clear away Merag and Durbe's grief, then?

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:33.370
Huh!?

00:13:37.670 --> 00:13:40.420
Merag...! Durbe...! Guys!

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:42.210
Come here!

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:50.550
Fantastic, so fantastic! I'm overflowing!

00:13:57.980 --> 00:13:59.860
Wha- what the heck's that?

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:01.150
That's...

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:06.360
... what his form is like after having absorbed 4 of the Seven Emperors of Barian!

00:14:07.570 --> 00:14:11.030
How does it look? That new form of mine?

00:14:11.530 --> 00:14:15.120
This is all thanks to those useless goof balls.

00:14:15.330 --> 00:14:16.500
Bastard!

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:18.750
Vector!

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:21.670
That's good. Rage, Nasch!

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:23.750
Rage like you did back then!

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:25.420
Back then?

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:28.680
Did you forget about this place?

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:32.180
Right, this is the place that tied the fates of us both.

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:36.310
After being beaten by you in the Ruin's Labyrinth,

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:40.650
I returned home barely alive.

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:51.450
But you bloody pushy bastard came chasing after me,

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:54.280
and wanted to invade me, all alone in this place.

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:59.750
Right... I remember... All of it.

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:05.090
Because you took the lives of all my friends and countrymen in our fight...

00:15:05.590 --> 00:15:08.010
There was no way forgiving you.

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:12.220
But when I got to this place here...

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:16.890
You had executed your entire country and all your servants...

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:19.180
... and were just standing there all alone.

00:15:22.060 --> 00:15:23.900
Yeah, that's...

00:15:24.820 --> 00:15:28.490
They all were annoying morons, always interfering...

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:31.240
Kept telling me to stop the war...

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:34.200
That's what that bunch of cowards kept on telling me, those idiots.

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:36.410
They were a nuisance, always getting in my way.

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:38.660
So I got rid of them.

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:40.790
How... horrible!

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:43.130
The Legend of the Cursed Palace...

00:15:43.630 --> 00:15:48.420
Indeed that Legend of the Ruins
was about Vector's time as a human...

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:51.590
That was low even for you, Vector.

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:54.850
You think, that bit is <i>low</i>?

00:15:54.850 --> 00:15:57.180
Dork. What a dork you are!

00:15:57.720 --> 00:16:02.640
You know, because the first ones I ever got rid off were...

00:16:04.230 --> 00:16:07.980
my own ol' man and that mother of mine!

00:16:10.650 --> 00:16:12.820
Your own...<i> parents</i>?!

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:16.870
After having taken the lives of everyone around him...

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:20.870
the prince took the life of the last person remaining - his own life.

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:25.380
Righto, because I got rid of all those annoying bastards,

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:27.380
I became invincible!

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:30.670
Until the day I lost to you Bastard there, that is.

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:32.220
Nasch!

00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:35.260
On <i>that</i> day, I lost again to you.

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:38.010
On top, in my <i>own</i> palace!

00:16:38.010 --> 00:16:40.720
It made me <i>miserable</i>! It was <i>frustrating</i>!

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:46.610
That's why this time, in this very place, I'll gonna crush you!

00:16:47.110 --> 00:16:51.940
And I'm gonna crush you with the power of <i>your beloved</i> friends!

00:16:52.400 --> 00:16:54.280
You bloody creep!

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:57.780
Now, here I come, Nasch!

00:16:57.910 --> 00:17:01.370
First, Umbral, attack his Dark Knight!

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:08.250
I activate the effect of my Dark Knight!

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:12.460
When Dark Knight is destroyed while it has Chaos Overlay Units,

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:15.590
this monster can Special Summon itself back from the Graveyard!

00:17:16.550 --> 00:17:18.800
Return from Limbo!

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:25.770
And then I gain Life Points equal to my Dark Knight's Attack!

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:35.530
But my attack ain't over yet!

00:17:35.610 --> 00:17:38.910
Noble Daemon, attack Dark Knight!

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:59.930
And without Chaos Overlay Units,
Dark Knight can't be Special Summoned back again!

00:18:00.100 --> 00:18:03.680
And next, Ragna Infinity, direct attack!

00:18:13.650 --> 00:18:14.940
Shark!

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:22.740
How's that? The feeling to be smashed by Merag's Monster?

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:27.160
Next up, Judge Devil!

00:18:27.580 --> 00:18:29.750
Attack Nasch directly!

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:41.090
Shark!

00:18:41.140 --> 00:18:43.180
His Life Points instantly dropped to 100!

00:18:44.260 --> 00:18:45.770
Nice shape you're in.

00:18:46.020 --> 00:18:47.640
But I won't let you off easily.

00:18:47.930 --> 00:18:52.110
There's plenty of tormenting to come
'til I send you to hell, Nasch!

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:55.940
I set 2 cards and end my turn.

00:18:57.610 --> 00:18:59.150
Vector...!

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:01.870
My turn... Draw!

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:06.620
I activate "Split Defender" from my hand!

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:11.830
If there are no monsters on my field,

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:16.380
I can take control of my opponent's monster with the highest Defense.

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:20.800
But if two or more monsters on the field have the same Defense...

00:19:20.840 --> 00:19:24.350
... my opponent gets to decide which monster changes control.

00:19:25.060 --> 00:19:27.850
Right now, those with the highest Defense are...

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:31.350
... Noble Daemon and Ragna Infinity.

00:19:31.900 --> 00:19:34.060
Now pick one of the Monsters!

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:38.490
You idiot! That's the card from your first draw,

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:41.150
you think, I didn't anticipate that you'll use that!?

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:43.370
Trap activate, "Guard Off"!

00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:45.410
With this card,

00:19:45.620 --> 00:19:48.910
the Defense of all monsters on the field turns to "Zero"!

00:19:49.710 --> 00:19:52.750
And for every monster whose Defense is Zero,

00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:55.920
I get to inflict 400 damage to you Scum!

00:19:57.300 --> 00:19:59.970
1600 Damage over all?!

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:01.470
He's read it that far?!

00:20:06.430 --> 00:20:09.430
Toodles, Nasch!

00:20:11.770 --> 00:20:13.150
Shark!!

00:20:15.060 --> 00:20:18.980
I activate the Continuous Trap Card, "Xyz Charge Up"!

00:20:19.230 --> 00:20:22.650
This card negates the Effect Damage!

00:20:24.280 --> 00:20:25.530
Yeah!

00:20:26.490 --> 00:20:29.950
I sure knew you were aware of the Split Defender in my hand,

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:32.580
did you think, I wouldn't expect any tricks from you?

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:34.460
I'm not a <i>blonde<i>, you know!</i></i>

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:38.920
The effect of my activated Split Defender still has to resolve!

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:44.300
Due to "Guard Off", every monster on your field now has Zero Defense!

00:20:45.550 --> 00:20:48.510
Now, pick one of them to give to me!

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:51.100
Judge Devil!

00:20:57.060 --> 00:21:00.690
You get a Monster with just 1600 ATK!

00:21:00.980 --> 00:21:02.490
That's all I need.

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:03.450
What?!

00:21:03.570 --> 00:21:06.530
I activate the other effect of my "Xyz Charge Up"!

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:09.200
By sending this card to the Graveyard,

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:12.410
I can have the ATK of 1 Xyz Monster I control on my field...

00:21:12.700 --> 00:21:16.580
increase by the amount of the negated damage from before!

00:21:17.210 --> 00:21:18.420
Say what?!

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:20.500
That's awesome!

00:21:20.550 --> 00:21:24.670
With this, Judge Devil has the highest Attack on the field!

00:21:25.090 --> 00:21:28.550
I have Judge Devil attack Umbral!

00:21:41.400 --> 00:21:43.280
Thi... this is...

00:21:43.650 --> 00:21:45.990
That feeling... just what...?

00:21:48.700 --> 00:21:50.330
What's with that light?

00:21:50.410 --> 00:21:51.700
Did you forget?

00:21:51.870 --> 00:21:56.160
When a Over Hundred Number is destroyed by it's Number from the Ruins...

00:21:56.710 --> 00:21:59.880
The true memories of the Ruin's master returns.

00:22:00.960 --> 00:22:02.170
Then...

00:22:09.930 --> 00:22:10.300
{marker}

00:22:10.300 --> 00:22:11.970
In the present, past and future,

00:22:11.970 --> 00:22:16.390
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:22:16.430 --> 00:22:18.650
'Til we can grab hold of them

00:22:18.690 --> 00:22:22.320
Challenge the GAME!

00:22:24.110 --> 00:22:24.940
Let it go.

00:22:35.330 --> 00:22:38.210
When there's a problem that can't be beaten,

00:22:39.080 --> 00:22:43.420
We'll just try again.

00:22:45.340 --> 00:22:49.340
You keep holding your heart inside your chest

00:22:49.340 --> 00:22:54.680
It's the power you get from keeping the faith.

00:22:54.810 --> 00:22:59.520
Even while you're discouraged and crying

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:05.400
Let's try to secure tomorrow with our bonds

00:23:05.690 --> 00:23:07.570
We can shatter anything

00:23:07.570 --> 00:23:11.950
Fear and fate and even the most fervent fantasies

00:23:12.240 --> 00:23:15.830
Keep on burning as you break through!

00:23:15.910 --> 00:23:17.580
In the Present, Past and Future

00:23:17.660 --> 00:23:22.040
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:23:22.130 --> 00:23:24.170
Let's go and reach out

00:23:24.340 --> 00:23:27.010
Beyond the limits

00:23:27.130 --> 00:23:29.420
'Til we can grab hold of them,

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:32.930
Challenge the GAME

00:23:40.890 --> 00:23:43.860
After learning his real past, Vector is soaked in tears.

00:23:43.980 --> 00:23:46.820
It's a sorrowful memory stained by blood.

00:23:46.940 --> 00:23:48.820
And to repay for his sins,

00:23:48.820 --> 00:23:52.200
he decides to head down the path of destruction at Don Thousand's side!

00:23:52.280 --> 00:23:54.280
Future starts right here!

00:23:54.320 --> 00:23:55.780
You wish to disappear together!?

00:23:55.780 --> 00:23:57.700
I'll finish you off as you wish!

00:23:57.830 --> 00:24:00.160
Shark! Please stop!

00:24:00.960 --> 00:24:02.920
Next Time, on Yu-Gi-Oh ZEXAL II!

00:24:02.960 --> 00:24:05.790
Vector's Trifling! Bonds of Trapped Friendship!!

00:24:06.130 --> 00:24:08.840
Shingetsu is the real you!
